---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About Us">
	<main class="section about-page">
		<div class="container panel about-panel" data-reveal>
			<h2>About Us</h2>

			<div class="about-content">
				<p>
					<strong>Paramount World Records</strong> is an independent Private Limited company headquartered
					in Mumbai, with operational presence in Chennai, Coimbatore, and Kancheepuram, and a vision to
					expand across India and internationally.
				</p>
				<p>
					Founded with the mission of recognizing excellence, celebrating achievement, and creating
					meaningful impact, Paramount World Records provides transparent record verification, expert
					evaluation, trusted certification, and global recognition for individuals, institutions,
					organizations, and communities.
				</p>
				<p>
					Beyond record certification, Paramount World Records has evolved into a comprehensive
					<strong>Experiential Learning, Leadership Development, and Corporate Transformation organization</strong>,
					helping businesses, educational institutions, clubs, associations, and communities achieve
					measurable growth through customized learning experiences.
				</p>
				<p>
					We believe that true transformation does not happen through conventional classroom training
					alone. It happens when people experience, participate, reflect, and apply learning in
					real-world situations. Our experiential learning programs combine activity-based workshops,
					leadership interventions, team-building exercises, business consulting methodologies, and
					corporate world record initiatives to create lasting behavioural change and organizational
					impact.
				</p>
				<p>
					Our team works closely with clients to understand their unique challenges, opportunities, and
					objectives before designing customized solutions tailored to their industry and workforce.
					From sales excellence and customer service enhancement to leadership development, employee
					engagement, and organizational growth, our programs are designed to deliver practical outcomes
					rather than temporary motivation.
				</p>
				<p>
					What makes Paramount unique is our ability to integrate
					<strong>Training, Transformation, Engagement, and Recognition</strong> into a single powerful
					ecosystem. Through our signature Corporate World Record Programs, organizations can unite
					employees around a common purpose while strengthening teamwork, culture, leadership, and brand
					visibility.
				</p>
				<p>
					Today, Paramount World Records serves educational institutions, corporate organizations, clubs,
					associations, startups, service industries, and community groups by creating impactful
					experiences that inspire achievement, celebrate excellence, and drive transformation.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="grid two about-vision-grid">
				<section class="panel about-vision-card" data-reveal>
					<h3>Our Vision</h3>
					<p>
						To become one of the world's most trusted platforms for recognition, experiential learning,
						and human transformation.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="panel about-vision-card" data-reveal>
					<h3>Our Mission</h3>
					<p>
						To inspire individuals and organizations to achieve extraordinary results through
						recognition, learning, innovation, collaboration, and meaningful experiences.
					</p>
				</section>
			</div>

			<p class="about-closing">
				<strong>Transforming Individuals. Strengthening Teams. Recognizing Excellence. Creating Impact.</strong>
			</p>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	.about-content {
		margin-top: 0.5rem;
		max-width: 52rem;
	}

	.about-content p {
		margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
		color: var(--text-secondary, #475569);
		line-height: 1.75;
		font-size: 0.98rem;
	}

	.about-content p:last-child {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}

	.about-vision-grid {
		margin-top: 1.75rem;
		gap: 1.25rem;
	}

	.about-vision-card {
		background: transparent;
		border: 1px solid rgba(196, 194, 188, 0.3);
	}

	.about-vision-card h3 {
		margin: 0 0 0.65rem;
		color: #c4c2bc;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
	}

	.about-vision-card p {
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--text-secondary, #475569);
		line-height: 1.7;
	}

	.about-closing {
		margin: 1.75rem 0 0;
		padding-top: 1.35rem;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle, #e2e8f0);
		text-align: center;
		font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.15rem);
		line-height: 1.55;
		color: var(--text-primary, #0f172a);
	}
</style>
